<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"><title>POST 1: 메뉴 등록</title></head>
<body>
  <h1>POST 1: 메뉴 등록</h1>
  <form method="post" action="/cafe_db024">
    <label>메뉴명 <input name="name" maxlength="100" required></label>
    <label>가격 <input type="number" name="price" min="-2147483648" max="2147483647" required></label>
    <label>카테고리 <input name="category" maxlength="100" required></label>
    <button type="submit">메뉴 등록</button>
  </form>
  <%- include("partials/cafe_db024", { cafe_db024 }) %>
  <p>폼 또는 주소를 통해 요청하고 조회 결과를 확인하세요.</p>
	<hr>

	<h2>메뉴 수정</h2>

	<form method="post" action="/cafe_db024/update">

	  <label>
	    수정할 메뉴 ID
	    <input type="number" name="id" min="1" required>
	  </label>

	  <label>
	    메뉴명
	    <input name="name" maxlength="100" required>
	  </label>

	  <label>
	    가격
	    <input type="number" name="price" min="0"
	           max="2147483647" required>
	  </label>

	  <label>
	    카테고리
	    <input name="category" maxlength="100" required>
	  </label>

	  <button type="submit">메뉴 수정</button>

	</form>
	
	<h2>메뉴 삭제</h2>

	<form method="post" action="/cafe_db024/delete">

	  <label>
	    삭제할 메뉴 ID
	    <input type="number" name="id" min="1" required>
	  </label>
	</form>
</body>
</html>
